{
 "plan": {
  "title": "Fitness Programme Impact Summary",
  "subtitle": "Overview of participant growth and performance changes from baseline to endline",
  "panels": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "kind": "kpi",
    "title": "Total Participants",
    "sql": "SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT \"Child ID\") AS n FROM (SELECT \"Child ID\" FROM \"baseline\" UNION SELECT \"Child ID\" FROM \"endline\") AS all_ids",
    "unit": ""
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "kind": "kpi",
    "title": "Avg. Shuttle Run Improvement",
    "sql": "SELECT AVG(e.\"Shuttle run sec\" - b.\"Shuttle run sec\") AS n FROM \"baseline\" b JOIN \"endline\" e ON b.\"Child ID\" = e.\"Child ID\" WHERE b.\"Shuttle run sec\" IS NOT NULL AND e.\"Shuttle run sec\" IS NOT NULL",
    "unit": "sec"
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "kind": "kpi",
    "title": "Avg. Sit Ups Gain",
    "sql": "SELECT AVG(e.\"Sit ups\" - b.\"Sit ups\") AS n FROM \"baseline\" b JOIN \"endline\" e ON b.\"Child ID\" = e.\"Child ID\" WHERE b.\"Sit ups\" IS NOT NULL AND e.\"Sit ups\" IS NOT NULL",
    "unit": "reps"
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "kind": "bar",
    "title": "Avg. Shuttle Run Time by Coach",
    "sql": "SELECT \"Coach\", AVG(\"Shuttle run sec\") AS avg_time FROM \"endline\" WHERE \"Shuttle run sec\" IS NOT NULL GROUP BY \"Coach\" ORDER BY avg_time ASC LIMIT 15",
    "x": "Coach",
    "y": [
     "avg_time"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p5",
    "kind": "bar",
    "title": "Avg. Sit Ups by Coach",
    "sql": "SELECT \"Coach\", AVG(\"Sit ups\") AS avg_situps FROM \"endline\" WHERE \"Sit ups\" IS NOT NULL GROUP BY \"Coach\" ORDER BY avg_situps DESC LIMIT 15",
    "x": "Coach",
    "y": [
     "avg_situps"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p6",
    "kind": "table",
    "title": "Top Performers by Improvement",
    "sql": "SELECT b.\"Child name\", b.\"School\", (e.\"Shuttle run sec\" - b.\"Shuttle run sec\") AS shuttle_diff, (e.\"Sit ups\" - b.\"Sit ups\") AS situps_diff FROM \"baseline\" b JOIN \"endline\" e ON b.\"Child ID\" = e.\"Child ID\" WHERE b.\"Shuttle run sec\" IS NOT NULL AND e.\"Shuttle run sec\" IS NOT NULL AND b.\"Sit ups\" IS NOT NULL AND e.\"Sit ups\" IS NOT NULL ORDER BY shuttle_diff ASC, situps_diff DESC LIMIT 10"
   }
  ],
  "narrative": "This programme engaged {{p1}} unique children across multiple locations. The data shows a clear trend in physical fitness improvements.\n\nOn average, participants improved their shuttle run times by {{p2}} seconds, indicating better speed and agility. Simultaneously, core strength increased with an average gain of {{p3}} sit-ups per child.\n\nPerformance varies by coach, with some groups showing faster shuttle run times and higher sit-up counts than others. The top performers list highlights individuals who made the most significant strides in both metrics."
 },
